 /// The rails differ in nothing else, but they must not share slugs: a
diff --git i/reims-vgpu/crates/reims-vgpu/src/backend/vulkan/engine/present_capture.rs w/reims-vgpu/crates/reims-vgpu/src/backend/vulkan/engine/present_capture.rs
